    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of GDPR compliance, we standard legal basis for data processing is Article 6(1)(e), performance of a task in public interest. we also have a DPA template version 3.2 and provide support for Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since the client's data will be hosted exclusively within EU, we do not foresee any issues with international data transfers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding EU AI Act, our company context indicates that we are aware of the regulatory requirements and have expertise in limited-risk AI transparency obligations. we also enforce human oversight contractual enforcement and have a policy against automated decision-making without human validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for legal risks, we should flag potential issues related to open-source license compliance, cross-border data flow (although cross-border data flow is an intra-EU operation), and vendor lock-in mitigation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company context suggests that we have measures in place to address legal risks, such as source code escrow capability, standard licenses like Apache 2.0 and MIT, and a no-copyleft GPL contamination policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on our company context, it appears that we are compliant with the relevant regulatory frameworks, including GDPR and EU AI Act, and can design the solution as a tool of assistance that requires explicit validation by an agent for automated decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation must remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our target gross margin percentage is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to determine our projected margin on this contract, our need to consider this contract budget of 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our pricing model includes a standard daily rate for various roles and a target gross margin, our can estimate our costs and projected revenue." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can maintain our target gross margin percentage, our projected cost would be approximately 2,160,000 euros (3,000,000 * (1 - 0.28)), and our projected revenue would be 3,000,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This would result in a gross margin of 840,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding cost-optimization strategies, our can propose the following: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Efficient resource allocation: our can optimize our resource allocation to ensure that the most suitable and cost-effective resources are assigned to this contract. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Infrastructure cost optimization: As our infrastructure margin percentage is 12%, our can explore opportunities to reduce infrastructure costs while maintaining the required level of service. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Software license resale margin optimization: If applicable, our can negotiate favorable terms for software licenses to maximize our resale margin, which is currently set at 8%. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Process improvements: our can implement process improvements to increase efficiency and reduce waste, which would help maintain or improve our target gross margin percentage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These strategies can help our optimize costs while delivering the required services to the local authority, ensuring that the annual cost of exploitation remains compatible with the local authority budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide recommendations or proposals that can be explained, and The solution should facilitate collaboration and continuity of processing between agents and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our AI capabilities meet these requirements, and what innovation strategy do you propose to enhance The solution value proposition?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has expertise in AI research and development, with a team size of 14, including 3 PhD researchers, and 7 years of experience in AI." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., have published 6 papers and made open-source contributions, such as LangChain plugins and RAG evaluation toolkit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements for explainability and collaboration, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., XAI methods, including source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP, and LIME, can provide explanations for the recommendations or proposals generated by Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., AI models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, with retrieval strategies like dense vector and BM25 sparse, can facilitate collaboration and continuity of processing between agents and services by providing relevant information and context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For innovation strategy, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., propose leveraging Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., current research topics, such as knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can also explore integrating our AI models with existing practices of the agents, ensuring a smooth transition and minimizing disruption to the agents workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To enhance the solution's value proposition, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., suggest fine-tuning Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, on the client's specific domain corpus, which has shown an average accuracy gain of 12%. fine-tuning can improve the quality and relevance of the generated recommendations or proposals while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining our AI capabilities with a deep understanding of the client's needs and constraints, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., believe Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can deliver a solution that meets the client's expectations and provides significant value to the client's organization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to limit The City of Belval environmental footprint, and the solution should contribute to reducing energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that the solution meets these sustainability requirements, and what eco-friendly practices can we propose to enhance we bid?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has a strong commitment to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The City of Belval environmental requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can highlight Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing eco-friendly practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have partnered with green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, which use 100% renewable energy. partnered significantly reduces the carbon footprint associated with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. data hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, which use 100% renewable energy have an ISO14001 certification, demonstrating green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, which use 100% renewable energy commitment to environmental management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our digital sobriety practices contribute to reducing our energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have an e-waste management partner, Ecologic in France, which is certified for WEEE recycling, ensuring responsible disposal of electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have the capability for carbon reporting based on GRI Standards (partial), allowing Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to monitor and report Nexus Engineering S.r.l. environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To enhance our bid, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose implementing these practices and technologies in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution for The City of Belval, thereby contributing to The City of Belval goal of reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing partnerships and practices, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can provide a sustainable solution that aligns with The City of Belval environmental objectives." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's digital transformation strategy aims to improve the efficiency of The City of Belval's administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As part of aims, our consortium proposes to design, implement, and deploy an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions. our consortium approach will ensure that an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions integrates with existing practices and systems, minimizing disruption to agents' workflows. our consortium will establish a steering committee to oversee the project, maintain a RAID log to track risks, assumptions, issues, and dependencies, and assign a dedicated change manager to handle training and support for municipal agents. our consortium change management capabilities include in-person workshops, e-learning, and quick reference guides, with typical training lasting 0.5 days per user. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying the agents' in the agents' administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will facilitate access to information, improve the quality of answers, and reduce processing times. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will also assist with drafting administrative contents, such as answers to users, administrative letters, and syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions will integrate with existing systems, including business software, electronic document management, and user directories. our consortium will use API integration, leveraging our consortium experience with REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, as well as API gateways like Kong and Apigee. our consortium technical expertise includes hosting on SecNumCloud-type infrastructure or equivalent, minimizing dependence on non-European suppliers. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions will be designed to provide times of response compatible with daily use by agents, with a target response time of less than 2 seconds. our consortium will prioritize high availability, aiming for an objective of 99.9%, and ensure that the system can contextualize answers in function of the demand of the agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The City of Belval's environmental requirements, an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions will contribute to reducing energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact. our consortium partner with green hosting providers like OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification. our consortium digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle. our consortium AI capabilities will provide explainable recommendations or proposals, facilitating collaboration and continuity of processing between agents and services. our consortium will fine-tune our consortium preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, on the client's specific domain corpus to enhance an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions value proposition, with an average accuracy gain of 12%. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions will be deployed progressively, starting with a pilot phase on a limited scope and generalizing to all services. our consortium will provide training for municipal agents and ensure that an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions integrates with existing practices and systems. our consortium budget for the project is estimated at 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that remains mastered and compatible with The City of Belval's budgetary capacities. our consortium propose a cost-optimization approach, including efficient resource allocation, infrastructure cost optimization, software license resale margin optimization, and process improvements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, our consortium is committed to delivering a comprehensive solution that meets The City of Belval's requirements and priorities. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions will improve the efficiency of administrative services, enhance the quality of service rendered to users, and contribute to reducing energetic consumption while relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact. our consortium are confident that a cost-optimization approach, including efficient resource allocation, infrastructure cost optimization, software license resale margin optimization, and process improvements will provide significant value to The City of Belval's and The City of Belval's citizens." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk19> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk2> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Context and objectives of the project In the framework of City of Belval digital transformation strategy, City of Belval wishes to improve the efficiency of City of Belval administrative services and the quality of service rendered to the users. the agents are today confronted with a growing complexity of the procedures, with a multiplicity of the sources of information (regulations, internal procedures, business systems) and with an increase of the volume of requests to process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk20> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk21> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk22> a prov:Entity ;
