    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Project Coordinator Agent at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., Project Coordinator Agent at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT to lead our consortium's." ;
