        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To coordinate our consortium's efforts to provide a comprehensive tender response that meets the client's needs and priorities, Project Coordinator Agent at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. propose the following approach:  Firstly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will establish a steering committee to oversee the project and ensure that all stakeholders are aligned. a steering committee to oversee the project and ensure that all stakeholders are aligned will meet monthly to review progress and make key decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

