    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Fourthly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will prioritize high availability (99.9%) and fast response times (<2 seconds) in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solution design, ensuring that the system meets the client's performance requirements." ;
