        ex:hasText "Based on the company context, our technical expertise includes API integration, which can be used to integrate The solution with existing systems such as business software, electronic document management, and user directories. our have experience with API standards like REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, as well as API gateways like Kong and Apigee." ;
