        ex:hasText "For hosting, our have experience with cloud providers including OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), which meets the requirement of hosting on SecNumCloud-type infrastructure. our also have expertise in containerization using Docker, Kubernetes, and Helm, which can be used to deploy The solution on the chosen infrastructure." ;
