        ex:hasText "Regarding dependence on non-European suppliers, our can design an architecture that minimizes dependence on non-European suppliers by using European-based cloud providers and open-source technologies where possible. you propose a microservices-based architecture that uses containerization and orchestration to deploy The solution on the chosen cloud infrastructure. a microservices-based architecture that uses containerization and orchestration to deploy the solution on the chosen cloud infrastructure will allow our to integrate with existing systems using APIs, while also ensuring scalability, security, and high availability. our can use our expertise in cybersecurity to ensure that The solution meets the required security standards, including encryption, network segmentation, and access control." ;
