        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our can use Terraform or Ansible for infrastructure as code, and deploy The solution on a Kubernetes cluster running on OVHcloud or Scaleway. our can also use our experience with monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack to ensure that the solution meets the required performance and availability standards." ;
