    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with GDPR compliance, having a Data Protection Officer appointed and being familiar with the RGS v2 (ANSSI) and SecNumCloud frameworks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure strict GDPR compliance for our solution, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement several security controls." ;
