        ex:hasText "For encryption, although the specific encryption methods are not detailed in Nexus Engineering S.r.l. context, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with security standards like ISO 27001 implies that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can implement appropriate encryption techniques to safeguard data." ;
