    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. incident response plan, which includes a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) and regular drills, ensures that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are prepared to handle any potential data breaches promptly and effectively, notifying relevant parties within the required 72-hour breach notification delay." ;
