    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with conducting Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) will be invaluable in identifying and mitigating risks associated with the processing of personal data within our solution, ensuring that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proactively address any GDPR compliance risks from the outset." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these security controls and adhering to Nexus Engineering S.r.l. established compliance practices, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can ensure that our solution meets The tender strict GDPR requirements." ;
